      "writtenOn": "2021-10-19T22:35:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done.\nWhere is the defaults configuration defined in zephyr?\n\nI can see CONFIG_ADC\u003dy and CONFIG_ADC_SHELL\u003dn in \"zephyr/boards/arm/volteer/volteer_defconfig\" file but these are not defined in \"zephyr/boards/arm/brya/brya_defconfig\". \n\nDo we need to add these in \"zephyr/boards/arm/brya/brya_defconfig\" file to enable by default ?",
