      "writtenOn": "2021-10-19T22:49:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Defaults are found in the various platform/ec/zephyr/Kconfig* files.\n\nLooks like CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_ADC defaults to y, and implies CONFIG_ADC.\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/81e812f8/zephyr/Kconfig.adc#5\n\nBut you shouldd CONFIG_ADC_SHELL\u003dn to this file.  This ensures that the \"adc\" console command is provided by the legacy platform/ec code instead of the upstream Zephyr \"adc\" command.",
